<title>USA: Alden Electronics sells land, building.</title>
<headline>Alden Electronics sells land, building.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alden Electronics Inc said Friday it has sold eight acres of land and a building to an unnamed Connecticut company for $400,000.</p>
<p>The 20,000-square-foot building had previously been used as a manufacturing facility by the company.</p>
<p>The company said it did not have permission from the buyer to disclose its name.</p>
<p>Alden provides weather data and weather information systems.</p>
</text>
